  "summary": {
    "as": "Introduced in Senate",
    "asOf": "2026-04-30",
    "date": "2026-08-28T19:56:26Z",
    "text": "This resolution honors the service and sacrifice of the\u00a0armed forces of the United Kingdom, Australia, and other partner nations that fought alongside U.S. troops in Afghanistan, Iraq, and other collective security and counterterrorism missions. The resolution expresses concern that retrospective, politically motivated accusations and investigations of war crimes against the forces of U.S. allies are harmful to alliance unity and servicemember\u00a0confidence."
